  "sourceText": "Canned Rotel Tomatoes\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Thursday, December 3, 2009 - 11:45pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\nPepper\nTomatoes\nSalt\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Place 4 medium-size peppers, chopped in a pint jar. Pack ripened tomatoes with peppers until jar is full. Put 1/2 teaspoon salt in jar and seal. Process in Mirromatic for minutes on 5 pounds pressure.",
